<h2>
About The Centre
</h2>



<p>

The Ceylon Wudang Wushu Research Centre is dedicated to preserving,
researching and promoting Wudang Martial Arts, Traditional Sri Lankan
Ayurveda, Meditation, Traditional Healing and Cultural Heritage.
Through research and practice, the Centre connects ancient wisdom
with modern generations.

</p>





<div class="about-highlights">



<div class="highlight-box">

<h3>
🥋 Martial Arts
</h3>

